146
00:07:52,620 --> 00:08:00,650
So that's what happens usually if maybe your TV is broken or it had some problem, you exchange it for a new one, right?

147
00:08:02,040 --> 00:08:04,100
But maybe you don't want the TV anymore.

148
00:08:04,100 --> 00:08:04,990
